{1}{G}, Sacrifice this creature: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)"""@en ;
    :flavorText """Its webs are not true silk, but woven from thousands of delicate mycosynth strands."""@en ;
